        ".ia/src/records/shared-root-authoring.ia",
        "apps/cli/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ia-canon-warning",
      "title": "IA canon (warning)",
      "summary": "The canon laws A6, C4, C5a, C12, E4, E5 and A14 now report their findings as warnings in `ia validate` and `ia preview`; nothing blocks yet. The language base moves to 3.2.1, so a door or runtime from this release refuses a kit locked on 3.2.0 until the kit is re-recorded on 3.2.1.",
